{"filePath":"/home/user/ainews/storylines/mathematicians-vs-labs.json","oldString":"Lance Fortnow's Computational Complexity blog recorded an update on 10/29 that \"Impagliazzo, Paturi and Williams set up a site to discuss the ETH Refutation with a discussion blog and paper repository.\"","newString":"Lance Fortnow's Computational Complexity blog recorded that \"Update (10/29): Impagliazzo, Paturi and Williams set up a site to discuss the ETH Refutation with a discussion blog and paper repository.\"","originalFile":"{
 "id": "mathematicians-vs-labs",
 "name": "Mathematicians vs the labs",
 "frame": "Working mathematicians pushing back on AI labs’ benchmark claims, while the labs keep posting competition results.",
 "status": "live",
