   "text": [
    "As of 2 November the dispute has two claimants to the same result and the beginnings of outside scrutiny. The openai/math history file records two manuscripts added on October 26, each with a Lean formalization, one of them \"The Exponential Time Hypothesis is False\", described as a deterministic, subexponential-time, polynomial-space algorithm for exactly counting satisfying assignments of fixed-width CNF formulas, with the 3-SAT case r

