{"filePath":"/home/user/ainews/data/2026-11-02.week.host.json","oldString":"In the same days Anthropic and xAI both switched on invisible text watermarking. Here's the detail I'd keep:","newString":"In the same days Anthropic and xAI both switched on invisible text watermarking, and The Decoder reports Anthropic pointing to the EU AI Act's December deadline as the reason it is watermarking its older models now. Here's the detail I'd keep:","originalFile":"{
