        { "text": "That's the week. The full review is on the site, with a link behind every claim, including the pages we couldn't open, and where we couldn't open them we've said so in the text. The daily briefing is back tomorrow morning with Maya and Alex. I'm Mike Shoss. Thanks for listening." }
      ]
    }
  ]
